["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Roland Fryer’s Relentless Search for Truth\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-econtalk-经济学家设百万美元奖金-奖励敢讲真话却得罪人的学者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>經濟學家設百萬美元獎金，獎勵敢講真話卻得罪人的學者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Roland Fryer 與 Bill Ackman 設立 Carob Trust Prize，獎勵那些誠實分析數據、即便結論不受歡迎、事後被證明站得住腳的社會科學家，核心是對抗學術界的自我審查。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">學術自由</span><span class=\"tag\">同行評審</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The One-Person Biotech | OpenAI Life Sciences capability overhang harness chain of evidence / chain of custody CMC trusted access\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-a16z-openai押注一人生物科技公司-2000个智能体替人类做实验分析/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI押注一人生物科技公司：2000個智能體替人類做實驗分析</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI life sciences負責人認為生物學的瓶頸不是數據太少，而是人類注意力有限；用上萬智能體並行掃描數據，能找到人類十幾二十年都沒發現的洞見。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">藥物研發</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vol.294｜當凱撒遇見MAGA：用羅馬史讀懂美國中期選舉｜主播：施展\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-cn27f438-凯撒联合失地平民架空元老院-这套剧本正在美国重演/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">49:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">東腔西調</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>凱撒聯合失地平民架空元老院，這套劇本正在美國重演</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">川普聯合鐵鏽地帶平民反建制派，與凱撒當年聯合失地羅馬平民架空元老院是同一套邏輯；這次中期選舉的民主黨大翻盤，不過是亂世裡一次應激性的回擺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬史</span><span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"We Gambled Away $10K on DraftKings … on Purpose loss chasing parlay micro bet cool-off period VIP host\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-papertrail-记者故意输掉一万美元-换来的是draftkings的vip邀请而非预警/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ab8a5a4c0feb5c2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">46:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>記者故意輸掉一萬美元，換來的是DraftKings的VIP邀請而非預警</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ProPublica記者刻意模仿問題賭徒的下注軌跡做實驗，結果輸錢行為被DraftKings的VIP系統當作「有價值客戶」的信號，責任博彩提示和加碼獎勵幾乎同時發到他手機上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">體育博彩</span><span class=\"tag\">成癮機制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What a Town Full of Vibecoders Says About the Chinese Economy RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) dark forest OPC (one-person company) Bazi AIGC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-oddlots-中国人拥抱ai不是因为乐观-是因为没有拒绝的选项/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">58:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>中國人擁抱AI不是因為樂觀，是因為沒有拒絕的選項</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">民調顯示83%中國人認為AI對生活工作有益，遠高於美國的38%，但記者說這種樂觀很大程度上是因為人們別無選擇，而不是真正的信心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI擴散</span><span class=\"tag\">良渚</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"LISTEN NOW: My Mom&#x27;s Murder Season 2 cocaine-induced agitated delirium\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-tides-母亲案发证据被销毁-法医仍坚持可卡因致死说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1e9bb828430258f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">10:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Tides of History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>母親案發證據被銷燬，法醫仍堅持可卡因致死說</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">等了22個月的DNA結果換來的是：頭髮、酒杯、指甲下的DNA從未送檢或已被銷燬，而法醫在兩次毒檢都顯示「乾淨」的情況下，仍傾向於認定死因是可卡因引發的譫妄。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">真實犯罪</span><span class=\"tag\">冷案調查</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Berlin Airlift Little Lift Iron Curtain\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-historyhit-柏林空运靠的不只是飞机-是把敌人变盟友的心理战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ce644f80fce9ba8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">34:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>柏林空運靠的不只是飛機：是把敵人變盟友的心理戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">斯大林切斷柏林陸路想困死西方佔領區，英美卻用一年30萬架次空運撐住了城市，順帶把德國人從戰敗敵人變成了冷戰盟友。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷戰</span><span class=\"tag\">柏林空運</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"190: 對話螞蟻蔡偉：靈光來做「個人Agent」，不是因為它很火 Thread MCP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-latetalk-灵光负责人-个人助理真正的壁垒-是敢替你担责任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/da37f8693b05fa41-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>靈光負責人：個人助理真正的壁壘，是敢替你擔責任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">螞蟻靈光把「辦事」換成「管事」：好的個人助理應該比你更關心你的事，並主動承擔責任，而不只是被動完成任務。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">螞蟻靈光</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"725. The Death of Captain Cook: At World’s End (Part 1) Terra Australis Incognita chronometer (K1 sea watch)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-restishistory-库克晚年突然性情大变-从温和的启蒙探险家到下令割耳烧村/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/20ce14dac773bc44-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>庫克晚年突然性情大變：從溫和的啟蒙探險家到下令割耳燒村</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">庫克前兩次航行裡始終約束部下、替當地人說話，第三次航行卻變得衝動易怒，下令72鞭抽打盜賊、燒燬20間房屋和18艘獨木舟，這種反常最終把他帶向了夏威夷海灘上的死亡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航海探險</span><span class=\"tag\">殖民史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"416. Boer War: The British Empire’s Fight For Survival (Part 1) Uitlanders commandos Randlords helots\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-empirehist-克鲁格称外来矿工为斯巴达农奴-布尔战争由此点燃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a240fc0f80e5872b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">53:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>克魯格稱外來礦工為斯巴達農奴，布爾戰爭由此點燃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃金讓一個靠種菜起家的荷蘭農民共和國變成大英帝國的眼中釘，米爾納用一份關於斯巴達農奴的電報把地方治安事件炒成開戰理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">殖民史</span><span class=\"tag\">南非</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why the Soviet GitHub Failed System/360 GosFAP ASU (avtomatizirovannie sistemy upravlenniia) ES-EVM / Ryad\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-22-asianometry-苏联版-github-为何失败-3万个程序只有500个能用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db13e18c31d74ac1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">24:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>蘇聯版 GitHub 為何失敗：3萬個程序只有500個能用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蘇聯建立了國家算法程序庫GosFAP試圖解決軟件重複造輪子的問題，但缺乏IBM式的硬件兼容標準和市場激勵，最終淪為一座存滿無用代碼的「軟件墓地」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">計算機史</span><span class=\"tag\">蘇聯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E259｜機械神教與反人性策略：華爾街量化巨頭的AI之路 alpha overfitting RSI execution infra alpha capacity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-22-sv101-量化巨头人均创收2000万美元-却说大模型读不懂市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:30:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>量化巨頭人均創收2000萬美元，卻說大模型讀不懂市場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">XTX Markets靠25000張GPU和200多人創造了全金融業最高的人均利潤，但兩位量化從業者都認為，通用大模型目前看不懂交易數據，真正的護城河是執行基建，不是模型本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量化交易</span><span class=\"tag\">高頻交易</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bars Have 90% Margins. Most Still Go Broke. dive bar speakeasy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-22-modernmba-酒吧毛利近九成仍倒闭过半-花钱买来的理由留不住客人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5d30fe7e35beed3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Modern MBA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>酒吧毛利近九成仍倒閉過半：花錢買來的理由留不住客人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">酒吧賣的從來不是酒而是出門喝酒的理由；能用錢買到的理由會被迅速複製失效，撐住酒吧的只有留不住的老闆和熟客。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">酒吧經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">獨立零售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"從 DeepSeek 限流到國產芯片困局，中國 AI 還能靠什麼追上美國？ harness agentic data CUDA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-22-cn561550-deepseek-限流不是省钱-是在算力上追不上美国的无奈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3bfa715b8efa75e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">58:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技亂燉</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>DeepSeek 限流不是省錢，是在算力上追不上美國的無奈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek 對 C 端限流的真實原因不是省錢，而是國產卡在數量和代差上遠落後海外頭部廠商，模型公司寧可把卡收回去做訓練也不願服務普通用戶。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">國產芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"First principles: What it takes to be a great product manager in the AI era | Sherif Mansour PM craft triangle artist PM AI builder bolting on AI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-22-lennys-ai时代pm不该写代码-吞吐量不再是瓶颈-方向才是/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9ceda05f276677fa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>AI時代PM不該寫代碼：吞吐量不再是瓶頸，方向才是</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Atlassian把PM、設計師都變成「AI builder」做實驗，一個月後團隊自己放棄了這種模式——因為AI讓產出變快了，但沒人知道該往哪划船。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">產品管理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI組織轉型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Would Anyone Spend $1 Billion on GTA 6? seigniorage payback period Iron Law of mega projects\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-22-patrickboyle-gta6-开发费15亿美元-但预购就已回本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2eb71149af422d0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">35:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Patrick Boyle</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>GTA6 開發費15億美元，但預購就已回本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rockstar花13年打磨一款遊戲，靠的是GTA Online每年近5億美元的穩定現金流，而不是急著出續作搶市場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">遊戲產業</span><span class=\"tag\">企業財務</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Replay: How the Internet Happened | Chris Dixon &amp; Brian McCullough (2018) quality score Web 2.0 low-hanging fruit\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-22-a16z-巨头押注完美宽带-输给了够用就行的糟糕网页/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>巨頭押注完美寬帶，輸給了夠用就行的糟糕網頁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迪士尼、微軟、Comcast 當年押注的是完美的機頂盒式寬帶方案，結果敗給了足夠簡陋、卻能讓極客自己上手寫代碼的網頁技術。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互聯網史</span><span class=\"tag\">商業模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1377: The Brightest Teen Scientists in New Jersey RIG-I TRIM25 K63 ubiquitination HMGB1 MAVS\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-22-twiv-dna病毒的武器竟瞄准rna探测器-还一箭双雕封锁两条免疫通路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>DNA病毒的武器竟瞄準RNA探測器，還一箭雙鵰封鎖兩條免疫通路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">腺病毒蛋白7本是DNA結合蛋白，卻被發現靠劫持TRIM25來壓制RNA免疫探測器RIG-I,順帶可能連DNA探測通路也一起封鎖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">病毒學</span><span class=\"tag\">先天免疫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"HoP 504 Finders Keepers: Hugo Grotius on Property Rights state of nature Law of Nations right of necessity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-22-hopwag-财产权不是上帝赐给亚当的-而是人类后来达成的协议/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">19:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>財產權不是上帝賜給亞當的，而是人類後來達成的協議</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">格勞秀斯認為自然狀態下人只有使用物品的權利，沒有佔有的權利，所有權是後來人類協議的產物，而不是上帝分給亞當後代的天賦。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自然法</span><span class=\"tag\">財產權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Neolithic Revolution lootable resources monopolizable weapons caged land hierarchical hunter-gatherers\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-22-ancients-埃及有法老-新几内亚没有-差别不在农业-而在作物能不能被抢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a5dfaa1c7d6f9660-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>埃及有法老，新幾內亞沒有：差別不在農業，而在作物能不能被搶</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新幾內亞和埃及幾乎同時發明農業，但薯芋類作物長在地下、難以囤積，小麥大麥卻能被儲存和掠奪——這決定了誰會走向國王與金字塔，誰不會。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">農業起源</span><span class=\"tag\">國家形成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Since last year, we asked: “What if AI solved the Riemann Hypothesis?” Riemann Hypothesis Lean Move 37\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-22-karpathy-ai若证明黎曼猜想却无人能懂-数学家说这根本不算数/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/69b7098cf2c4d5b7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>AI若證明黎曼猜想卻無人能懂，數學家說這根本不算數</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一場關於「天書證明」的思想實驗揭示：證明的價值不在於把真假確定到100%，而在於能否被人理解，這才是數學家真正在乎的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">黎曼猜想</span><span class=\"tag\">數學證明</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Episode 257 - The Rhynie Chert Lagerstätte sinter / geyserite mycorrhizal antheridium trigonotarbid\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-22-thecommondesce-苏格兰一块石头冻住了地球最早的陆地生态系统-连精子射出瞬间都保住了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f1123c3476b2c469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:18:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Common Descent Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1122</span></div>\n<h2>蘇格蘭一塊石頭凍住了地球最早的陸地生態系統，連精子射出瞬間都保住了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rhynie Chert 是一處4億1千萬年前的熱泉硅華沉積，植物、真菌、線蟲在礦化瞬間被整體封存，連繁殖細胞釋放的那一刻都清晰可見。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古植物學</span><span class=\"tag\">真菌共生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1376: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin congenital syphilis Sokova (Zokova) turn wild into mild\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-21-twiv-美国正式失去麻疹消除地位-本土持续传播已成常态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>美國正式失去麻疹消除地位：本土持續傳播已成常態</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">泛美衛生組織確認美國本土麻疹已從「輸入性散發」變成「本土持續傳播」，每週新增病例超200例，而CDC一度拒絕及時公布死亡數據。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Frederick the Great | Extra History Complete | European History oblique attack pragmatic sanction Diplomatic Revolution of 1756\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-21-extracredits-被父亲虐待的王子长大后成了普鲁士最能打的国王/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d280cab8b0804908-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">48:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>被父親虐待的王子長大後成了普魯士最能打的國王</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">弗里德里希大帝靠「誰先動手誰贏」和步兵的齊射隊形，把一個二流邊緣小國打成了能跟哈布斯堡叫板的強權，代價是七年戰爭幾乎把普魯士滅國。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歐洲史</span><span class=\"tag\">軍事戰術</span>\n</div></div></a>"]